==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|итти́|ити́||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ey-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|ити}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*jьti||to go}}. The infinitive spelled with {{m|ru||д}} is attested since the 14th century, under influence of {{m|ru|иду́}}, {{m|ru|идёшь}}, etc.
Past tense {{m|ru|шёл}} from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*šьdlъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|идти́|gem=y}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-идти.ogg}}

===Verb===
[[File:G. Caillebotte - Homme portant une blouse.jpg|thumb|Идти.]]
{{ru-verb|идти́|impf|pf=пойти́}}

# to [[go]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Идём''' [[в]] [[кинотеа́тр]]!|'''Let's go''' to the movie theater!}}
# to [[walk]]
# {{lb|ru|of precipitation}} to [[fall]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Идёт''' [[дождь]].|It’s raining.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Идёт''' [[снег]].|It’s snowing.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Идёт''' [[град]].|It’s hailing.}}
# to [[function]], to [[work]] (of clocks and watches)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[эти|Э́ти]] [[часы́]] [[не]] '''иду́т'''.|This clock/watch doesn't '''work'''.}}
# to [[suit]], to [[become]] {{gloss|of wearing clothes}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[этот|Э́тот]] [[костю́м]] [[он|ему́]] '''идёт'''.|This suit suits him.}}
# {{qualifier|used in expressions}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[время|Вре́мя]] '''идёт''' [[бы́стро]].|Time flies.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[ещё]] [[куда́]] [[ни]] '''шло'''.|That's still all right. (colloquial)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[их|Их]] [[товар|това́ры]] '''иду́т''' [[хорошо́]].|Their products '''are selling''' well.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[о|О]] [[что|чём]] '''идёт''' [[речь]]?|What is being talked about? / What is it all about? / What is the topic? / What are you guys talking about?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[речь|Речь]] '''идёт''' [[о]] [[два|двух]]/[[три|трёх]] [[вещь|веща́х]].|They're talking about two/three things.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[весь|Всё]] '''идёт''' [[по]] [[план|пла́ну]].|Everything '''is going''' as planned.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в|Во]] [[ско́лько]] '''идёт''' [[этот|э́та]] [[переда́ча]]?|What time '''is''' this (television) program '''on'''?}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[не]] '''идёт''' [[ни]] [[в]] [[какой|како́е]] [[сравне́ние]] [[с]] [[что-либо|че́м-либо]]/[[кто-либо|ке́м-либо]].|It cannot be compared with something/someone.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''идти́''' [[на]] [[компроми́сс]]|to [[compromise]], make a [[compromise]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[идти́ на усту́пки]]|to compromise, make concessions}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[идти́ на риск]]|to run a risk, take a chance}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[идти́ на всё]]|to be ready to do anything, go to any length}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[идти́ по пята́м]]|to follow in someone's footsteps; to follow on the heels of}}

====Usage notes====
* {{U:sla:directional verb|ru|uni|impf=идти́|pf=пойти́|other=ходи́ть}}
* Prefixed derivatives of this verb are formed using the combining form {{m|ru|-йти́}}.
* Идти has a special [[first person|first-person]] [[plural]] [[imperative]] form, [[идёмте]], which carries the same meaning as [[давайте]] [[пойдём]] and means "[[let's go]]."

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|irreg|идти́|pradp2=и́дучи1|notes=1 Dated}}
{{ru-conj-old|impf-intr|irreg|идти́|pradp2=и́дучи1|notes=1 Dated}}

